From: Omarchy Cast maintainers <packaging@localhost>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:00:00 +1200
Subject: [PATCH] Use GPU Screen Recorder for clocked WFD capture

wf-recorder 0.6 declares audio in its NUT stream but emits no audio packets
while the monitor is idle. That makes the muxer hold video and later release
an invalid multi-second burst. GPU Screen Recorder emits clocked silent AAC,
captures and scales on the GPU, and provides H.264 and AAC on one timeline.
Remux those streams without a second encode.
---
